    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s12-t02-drill-05-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第5题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s12-t02-drill-05",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（24江苏）小张所在单位共有4个科室，现以科室为单位组织文艺演出，每个科室出2个节目。演出结束后，因8个节目都非常精彩，决定从中随机选3个节目参加上级组织的汇演。则小张所在科室出的节目至少有一个被选送参加汇演的概率是：",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "3/14"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "17/21"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "13/21"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "9/14"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "D",
        "sourceAnswer": "D"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          129
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          123
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s12-t02-drill-05-p129.webp",
            "alt": "概率问题（一） · 实战精刷5 · 讲义第123页",
            "pdfPage": 129
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s12-t02-drill-05-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s12-t02-drill-05",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：D"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们看到“至少一个”，先算反面更省事。反面是小张科室的2个节目都没入选，3个节目全部从另外6个中选。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "总方案8选3=56，反面6选3=20，所以所求概率1−20/56=9/14。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "P=1-\\frac{\\binom63}{\\binom83}=\\frac9{14}"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们选D。直接算恰好1个或恰好2个也可以，但需要分两类。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
